The query in 0result.sql correctly  
• filters to real purchases (status IN ('Complete','Shipped')),  
• isolates genuine product‑page views via event_type = 'product',  
• extracts the numeric product_id robustly with a regex, and  
• links those views to the products in the top‑selling category before computing the dwell‑time average.  

The other options either ignore purchase‑status filtering (2result.sql) or rely solely on URI patterns that are slightly less robust (1result.sql).  

